        "explanation": "Doctor assigns next action, owner, timing, and contingency for the observation period.",
        "quote": "现在最重要是两件事：1. 继续配合现场治疗，不要擅自漏打、停打抗凝针 2. 一旦出现下面任何一条，马上当场叫医生护士"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00075",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly interprets leg ultrasound result, distinguishing muscular venous stasis from deep vein thrombosis and explaining its limited meaning.",
