        "quote": "对，病区阶段你们家属现在主要就是盯这些红旗，理解是对的"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately instructs not to wait if there are acute high-risk symptoms like worsening dyspnea or hypoxemia.",
        "quote": "只要出现下面任一情况，就不要只等检查了，要立刻再叫急诊医生"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00208",
        "explanation": "Doctor creates a realistic bedside communication script tailored to caregiver fatigue and staged results.",
        "quote": "你接下来不用反复追着问很多专业词，抓住一句就行：‘我们会继续观察红旗症状，也按医嘱继续抗凝。请问心超结果一出来，麻烦及时告诉我们有没有右心负担或病情升级证据。’"
      }
    ]
  },
