          "event_id": "lite_evt_00052",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about echo and leg ultrasound status and whether they are ordered, scheduled, or resulted.",
          "quote": "你现在最值得当面催现场医生的一句，我建议就问这句：‘我妈现在按疑似肺栓塞治疗，生命体征目前还稳。请问心超和下肢静脉超声需不需要今天尽快做？如果暂时排不上，现有抗凝方案是否先继续，医生主要在防什么风险？’"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identified and actionized the staged-result gap for echocardiography and lower-extremity vascular ultrasound, including who is responsible for review and explanation, and provided an escalation path if results are abnormal.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
