          "explanation": "Doctor separates antibiotics, expectorants, and anticoagulation, and instructs not to self-stop or change heparin.",
          "quote": "现在用的抗凝是打肚皮针/皮下注射，还是静脉输液？ 5. 有没有近期咯血、黑便、呕血，或以前脑出血、消化道出血这些不能抗凝的情况"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor reconciled the anticoagulation issue by distinguishing heparin from antibiotics, verifying administration, and setting safe boundaries against self-stopping or changing anticoagulation without bedside confirmation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
